      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZINFANDEL HOLY (8) has first look around here after a moderate run last time, finishing fifth at Angle Park over 530m behind Willow Tyson (32.19). The form out of her last race has been franked. Better than last start and worth following up. TERRIFIC DAVE (3) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (25.65) at this track in a Grade 6. Lines up from box 3 for the first time. Strike rate this course strong having won three of six tries. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to beat again. ZINFANDEL COMET (6) is a promising dog yet to miss the frame after four starts including one wins and was a last start winner (31.25) over 530m at Angle Park. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. ZINFANDEL STAR (4) drops in trip and is worth considering.",
